00:03:17.926 --> 00:03:22.330
&gt;&gt; I WAS ABLE TO JOIN NEIL AND

00:03:22.331 --> 00:03:25.499
MIKE ON THE SATURN 5 THAT DAY.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:29.670
NOW I LOOK FORWARD TO AMERICA'S

00:03:29.671 --> 00:03:34.809
LEADING ROLE IN A NEXT STEP

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:35.309
SPACE ALLIANCE.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:40.615
&gt;&gt; BUZZ ALDRIN STILL KICKING.

00:03:40.616 --> 00:03:41.382
UNBELIEVABLE.

